  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "About this space<br><br>Sleeps 18!<br><br>6-Seater LSV/golf cart included complimentary!<br><br>Just a 3-minute walk to the beach and other local favorites!<br><br>Enjoy a private heated pool, hot tub, outdoor shower, BBQ grill, ping pong table, corn hole, wet bar, 3 KING Rooms + a bunk room, two living spaces, designer finishes throughout, and MORE!<br><br>Gorgeous home in Prime Seagrove Eastern Lake! Pet friendly upon approval.<br><br>The space<br><br>Welcome to \"Knot for Reel!\"<br><br>Outside, enjoy your own private outdoor oasis, complete with a refreshing pool, hot tub, sunny deck with loungers, BBQ grill, corn hole, and an outdoor shower for rinsing off after the beach. It's the perfect spot to unwind!<br><br>Step inside the front door to a bright and open main living space that's great for spending time together. The living room has a big comfy sectional and flows seamlessly into the dining area with a large table with seating for 10. The fully equipped kitchen features high-end appliances, custom cabinetry, a spacious pantry, plus barstool seating for 6. Also on this floor is a half bathroom, and a spacious King bedroom with a private en-suite bathroom with a glass shower.<br><br>Moving up to the second floor, you'll find the laundry room along with three additional cozy bedrooms. The first is the master bedroom, featuring a King bed and an en-suite bathroom with dual vanities and a glass shower. The second bedroom has a King bed and an en-suite bathroom with a glass shower. The third bedroom has a Queen bed plus a set of built-in Twin-over-Twin bunk beds, also with an en-suite bathroom with a glass shower.<br><br>Lastly, the third floor is a fun hangout zone, with a second living room, ping pong talbe, a wet bar, a game/dining table, and multiple other small seating areas! The last bedroom is also located on this floor, featuring two sets of built-in Queen-over-Queen bunk beds.<br><br>You're just a short walk to the beach, as well as great restaurants and shops like Greenway Station, Old Florida Fish House, Beachy Bean Coffee Co., Steamboat Grill, and more! Plus, you're only a quick LSV/golf cart ride away from The Big Chill and Seaside!<br><br>This stunning home has everything you need and more for the perfect 30A getaway!<br><br>SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS (Sleeps 18 Guests):<br><br>FIRST FLOOR<br>-Living Room<br>-Dining Room<br>-Kitchen<br>-Half Bathroom<br>-Bedroom 1: King bed, en-suite bathroom with glass shower<br><br>SECOND FLOOR<br>-Laundry Room<br>-Bedroom 2 (Master): King bed, en-suite bathroom with dual vanities, glass shower<br>-Bedroom 3: King bed, en-suite bathroom with glass shower<br>-Bedroom 4: Queen bed + one set of Twin-over-Twin bunks, en-suite bathroom with glass shower<br><br>THIRD FLOOR<br>-Living Room 2<br>-Wet Bar<br>-Bedroom 5: Bunk room with two sets of Queen-over-Queen bunks, hallway bathroom with shower/tub combination<br><br>There is also a pack n' play and air mattress at the home for guests' use!<br><br>Guest access<br><br>There is parking available for 3-4 cars in the driveway!<br><br>Please note that the Eastern Lake Beach Access involves wading through a small portion of the lake.<br><br>Other things to note<br>-Pet friendly upon approval. Please inquire for non-refundable pet fee based on breed(s) and size(s).<br>-Please note we provide a starter set of supplies such as toilet paper, paper towels, trash bags, dishwasher + laundry pods for your stay.<br>-Check in is 4:00 PM & check out is 10:00 AM. Late check out / early check in may be subject to another day's rental fees.<br>-Smoking is prohibited.<br>-All renters must be over 25 years of age, or if under age 25 must be accompanied by a parent/legal guardian.<br>-LSV/golf cart is not to be driven past the town of Rosemary Beach to the East or the town of WaterColor to the West. Resolving any issue from the LSV/golf cart battery dying because of the renters not charging it will be charged to the renters.<br>-Please note that a $30 gas fee for the LSV/golf cart will need to be paid.<br>-Pool and hot tub/spa heating must be for the full duration of your stay and must be requested 48 hours prior to check-in and paid before the heater will be turned on. Pool heating cost is $50/night of your reservation and is available October 1st - April 30th. After April 30, guests can still heat the spa or hot tub for the same daily rate.<br>-Damage that occurs will be collected from the renters.<br>-Southern Holiday Homes can not be held liable for any damage or injury to any persons caused by LSV/golf cart, pool, or other amenities provided to guests.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Sleeps 18! Private Pool, Hot Tub, LSV/Golf Cart, 2 Living Rooms, & Pet Friendly!"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    },
